  "description": "The Blue Box is host to a collection of individually purchasable games:\n• Make burgers with physics to earn minimum wage in BurgerGame.\n\n• Negotiate the price of food items as a llama in Llama goes to Market.\n\n• Realize the full extent of humanity in YWDH.\n\n• Race against other ostriches to escape the police in DDAFPST Ostriches.\n\n• Play basketball across the globe in BBA SLAM.\n\n• Go back in time to snap some sweet pics of creatures in Oligocene Snapshot.\n\n• Pilot a futuristic jet at breakneck speeds through a sci-fi city in Normality.\n\nThe Blue Box is also host to a gallery of toys and other completely free game experiments:\n• Raise your virtual forever friend in Pocket Dootie.\n\n• Live a day in the life of a fabric weaving friend in Pube Spider (I Love You).\n\nMore and more games are being added over time, thanks to everyone's support.",
  "description_short": "The Blue Box is a compilation of games by where you can: Dunk the world, Discuss GNU/Linux on the moon, Do enough drugs to achieve space flight, Earn minimum wage, Existential Dread, &amp; Travel back in time and take some sweet pics of creatures!",
